      "releaseNotes": "New:\n• Photographic Styles — fine-tune tone and color of your photos later in the Photos app. Experimental, turn it on under Settings → Processing\n• Manual Aperture — set the f-stop yourself on iPhones with a variable aperture\n\nImproved:\n• Refreshed Settings design\n• Reliable photo saving, even when you leave the app right after the shot\n• Screen stays on while you shoot\n• Steadier zoom when video recording starts\n• Stability and performance improvements",
