      "releaseNotes": "New:\n• Photographic Styles — all 16 styles are now part of the Look Manager. Refine any look with Style, Tone, Color and Palette. Your photos are saved with the style applied\n• New Look Manager — pick looks and film profiles faster, resize the preview, switch lenses right in the preview and edit one tool at a time. Plus a new tone curve\n\nImprovements:\n• Every built-in look can now use any film profile\n• HEIF photos stay adjustable in the Photos app\n• Stability and performance improvements",
