      "description": "IIWII. It is what it is.\n\nA film simulation camera for your iPhone. Pick a look, see it live in the viewfinder, press the shutter. Your photo comes out finished, with real grain and the colors of analog film. No editing afterwards, unless you want to.\n\nFILM LOOKS, LIVE\nNegative, slide and black-and-white looks, inspired by the film stocks photographers love. Set grain and strength for every look right in the camera. Halation adds the red glow around bright lights you know from tungsten film.\n\nBRING YOUR OWN LOOKS\nImport any .cube file and shoot with it live. In the Look Manager you shape every detail of a look: light, color, grain, halation and Photographic Styles.\n\nMADE FOR FILM PHOTOGRAPHY\nNatural Processing captures a single frame without Deep Fusion or Smart HDR, for texture that looks like film, not like a phone. RAW+ saves a DNG next to every photo on every iPhone, up to 48 MP.\n\nBUILT LIKE A REAL CAMERA\n• Manual white balance, shutter speed, ISO and focus\n• Lenses in millimeters\n• Portrait, timer and double exposure in a top bar you set up yourself\n• Video with your look applied\n• Open IIWII from the Lock Screen, Control Center or with Camera Control\n• Throwback: give a photo a different look later, from the clean original\n\nEVERY IPHONE\nFrom the iPhone 6s to the newest models. On iPhone Duo, IIWII puts the viewfinder next to the controls on the large inner display. A lighter IIWII runs on iOS 15 to 17, the full app on iOS 18 and later.\n\nYOUR PHOTOS STAY YOURS\nPay once. No subscription, no account, no tracking. Your photos stay on your iPhone. Location in your photos is optional and stays off when you share.\n\nMADE WITH YOU\nIIWII comes from one independent developer who reads every message. Many features started as wishes from IIWII photographers.",
